{"2859330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Redundant", "steam_appid": 2859330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the metallic boots of an abandoned robot in <i><strong>The Redundant</strong></i>, an exciting action-adventure with multiple ways to play. Take on the role of CF5, an abandoned robot in a mysterious facility besieged by a virus-infected mechanical army. As you explore the facility, you'll unravel a twisting story while isolating each section from the network, before it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859330/extras/6f58e8692b9957f51714cb2e86849ac0.poster.avif?t=1750675784\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859330/extras/6f58e8692b9957f51714cb2e86849ac0.webm?t=1750675784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859330/extras/6f58e8692b9957f51714cb2e86849ac0.mp4?t=1750675784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Go in all-guns-blazing, or opt for a stealthy approach. Will you take the battle to your foes, or stick to the shadows?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859330/extras/a1e939e5596c0f43992db868dc58fd58.poster.avif?t=1750675784\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859330/extras/a1e939e5596c0f43992db868dc58fd58.webm?t=1750675784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859330/extras/a1e939e5596c0f43992db868dc58fd58.mp4?t=1750675784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>With different ways to play, you'll need your wits about you to manage the meager resources at your disposal. Think carefully and plan tactically in order to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859330/extras/d75f9960b715b6486e149386af550dab.poster.avif?t=1750675784\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859330/extras/d75f9960b715b6486e149386af550dab.webm?t=1750675784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859330/extras/d75f9960b715b6486e149386af550dab.mp4?t=1750675784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Enemies each have unique strengths and weaknesses, while a diverse array of environments each present their own obstacles. How will you make it through?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859330/extras/02be6335e79acb648e2b2dd1fd198471.poster.avif?t=1750675784\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859330/extras/02be6335e79acb648e2b2dd1fd198471.webm?t=1750675784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859330/extras/02be6335e79acb648e2b2dd1fd198471.mp4?t=1750675784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Unpick the mystery of the facility and the virus that has ravaged its robot denizens. Tease apart the story piece-by-piece as you fight for survival.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the metallic boots of an abandoned robot in <i><strong>The Redundant</strong></i>, an exciting action-adventure with multiple ways to play. Take on the role of CF5, an abandoned robot in a mysterious facility besieged by a virus-infected mechanical army. As you explore the facility, you'll unravel a twisting story while isolating each section from the network, before it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859330/extras/6f58e8692b9957f51714cb2e86849ac0.poster.avif?t=1750675784\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859330/extras/6f58e8692b9957f51714cb2e86849ac0.webm?t=1750675784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859330/extras/6f58e8692b9957f51714cb2e86849ac0.mp4?t=1750675784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Go in all-guns-blazing, or opt for a stealthy approach. Will you take the battle to your foes, or stick to the shadows?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859330/extras/a1e939e5596c0f43992db868dc58fd58.poster.avif?t=1750675784\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859330/extras/a1e939e5596c0f43992db868dc58fd58.webm?t=1750675784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859330/extras/a1e939e5596c0f43992db868dc58fd58.mp4?t=1750675784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>With different ways to play, you'll need your wits about you to manage the meager resources at your disposal. Think carefully and plan tactically in order to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859330/extras/d75f9960b715b6486e149386af550dab.poster.avif?t=1750675784\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859330/extras/d75f9960b715b6486e149386af550dab.webm?t=1750675784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859330/extras/d75f9960b715b6486e149386af550dab.mp4?t=1750675784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Enemies each have unique strengths and weaknesses, while a diverse array of environments each present their own obstacles. How will you make it through?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859330/extras/02be6335e79acb648e2b2dd1fd198471.poster.avif?t=1750675784\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859330/extras/02be6335e79acb648e2b2dd1fd198471.webm?t=1750675784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859330/extras/02be6335e79acb648e2b2dd1fd198471.mp4?t=1750675784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Unpick the mystery of the facility and the virus that has ravaged its robot denizens. Tease apart the story piece-by-piece as you fight for survival.</p>", "short_description": "Step into the metallic boots of an abandoned robot and fight back against an army of virus-infected machines. In this exciting action-adventure, sneak or battle your way around the facility, uncover its secrets, and isolate each section from the network - before it's too late...",